{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CubeMatch is a 3D puzzle game where you match the color of every cube. Selecting a cube changes the color of itself and adjacent cubes. Any number of clicks will solve the puzzle and any color will work, but try to complete it within the maximum number of clicks shown for an extra achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 7 colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night mode for a dark background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional display hint showing order of the colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color palette intended to be colorblind friendly (see below)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are colorblind, check that the palette below works for you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014430/extras/6e05202eb3d9eecb993d039080fa5907.avif?t=1760119917\" width=524 height=74 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014430/fb8fff124e68711dbff46e9fb53a290d0cbc72f3.jpg"},{"name":"Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014430/b69cfc901271417f88b41c95fb1d037f9dd97270.jpg"},{"name":"Level 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014430/7b1eb6fe8b6daa21b78b2f795c7d36227d42f93d.jpg"},{"name":"Level 40","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014430/8c968ba186b8b5869182b0ece494c7a2366bcc27.jpg"},{"name":"Level 60","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4014430/da104ada47c7377529ffd3a58b064bb67ee31d19.jpg"},{"name":"Le